<!-- 评估报告（WM10/FEAT-066）：竖版整页展示（docs/15 §十九 报告类图片展示规范） -->
<view class="page-bg">
  <view class="obs-hero">
    <image class="obs-hero-icon" src="/icons/ui/clipboard.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="obs-hero-main">
      <view class="obs-hero-title">{{childName}} 的评估报告</view>
      <view class="obs-hero-sub">由馆内老师评估上传 · 每一阶段的成长记录</view>
    </view>
    <view class="obs-hero-count" wx:if="{{reports.length}}">
      <text class="obs-hero-count-num">{{reports.length}}</text>
      <text class="obs-hero-count-unit">期</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="obs-loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>

  <empty-state wx:if="{{!loading && !reports.length}}"
    icon-name="clipboard" title="还没有评估报告" desc="老师上传后这里会展示" />

  <!-- 最新一期：整页展开（家长第一眼要看清的就是它） -->
  <view class="obs-paper" wx:if="{{latest}}">
    <view class="obs-paper-head">
      <view class="obs-issue">最新 · 第 {{latest.issue}} 期</view>
      <text class="obs-date">{{latest.dateText}}</text>
      <text class="obs-pages">{{latest.imageUrls.length}} 页</text>
    </view>

    <view class="obs-comment" wx:if="{{latest.remark}}">
      <image class="obs-comment-icon" src="/icons/ui/tip.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <view class="obs-comment-body">
        <view class="obs-comment-label">老师评语</view>
        <view class="obs-comment-text">{{latest.remark}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="obs-pages-wrap">
      <view class="obs-page" wx:for="{{latest.imageUrls}}" wx:key="*this"
        data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onPreviewLatest">
        <image class="obs-page-img" src="{{item}}" mode="widthFix" />
        <view class="obs-page-no">{{index + 1}}/{{latest.imageUrls.length}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="obs-hint">
      <image class="obs-hint-icon" src="/icons/ui/search.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <text>点图可放大看细节 · 长按可保存到相册</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 往期：默认收起，点标题行展开 -->
  <view class="obs-hist" wx:if="{{history.length}}">
    <view class="obs-hist-head" bindtap="toggleHistory">
      <text class="obs-hist-title">往期报告（{{history.length}} 期）</text>
      <image class="obs-hist-arrow {{historyOpen ? 'is-open' : ''}}"
        src="/icons/ui/arrow-down.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{historyOpen}}">
      <view class="obs-hist-card" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:for-item="rep" wx:key="id"
        data-report="{{rep.id}}" bindtap="onPreviewHistory">
        <view class="obs-hist-thumb">
          <image class="obs-hist-thumb-img" src="{{rep.imageUrls[0]}}" mode="aspectFill" />
          <view class="obs-thumb-no">{{rep.imageUrls.length}} 页</view>
        </view>
        <view class="obs-hist-info">
          <view class="obs-hist-line">
            <text class="obs-hist-issue">第 {{rep.issue}} 期</text>
            <text class="obs-hist-date">{{rep.dateText}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="obs-hist-remark" wx:if="{{rep.remark}}">{{rep.remark}}</view>
          <view class="obs-hist-more">点开可放大查看</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>
